      "data_note_zh": "表中给出多种水溶液电解质在 25 °C、低浓度区的互扩散系数，浓度点为 0–0.010 mol/L；原表单位为 10^-5 cm2/s，已换算为 m2/s。浓度 0 作为表列极限/参考点保存，不当作有限浓度测点。"
    },
    "bard_faulkner_2001": {
      "citation": "A. J. Bard, L. R. Faulkner, Electrochemical Methods: Fundamentals and Applications, 2nd ed. (2001), Table 2.3.1, p. 68; table cites D. A. MacInnes, The Principles of Electrochemistry (1961), p. 85 and references therein.",
