      "data_note_zh": "KNO3 水溶液 25 °C 的阳离子迁移数汇编值；表中浓度为当量浓度。KNO3 为 1:1 电解质，数值上等于 mol/L。该表是二次汇编，未在此库中补造测量不确定度。"
    },
    "sinha_bhat_1988": {
      "citation": "A. Sinha, S. N. Bhat, Transference numbers in aqueous cupric sulfate solution: effect of concentration and temperature at constant pH, Journal of Chemical and Engineering Data 33(4) (1988), 393–394. DOI: 10.1021/je00054a001.",
      "url": "https://doi.org/10.1021/je00054a001",
      "data_note_zh": "Hittorf 法测得的 CuSO4 表观阳离子迁移数。论文讨论了酸性 CuSO4 溶液中 H+ 对表观迁移数的影响；表格还列有随浓度变化的 pH。与未记录 pH/酸度的本项目配方不匹配，只作文献记录。"
    },
    "miller_rard_eppstein_robinson_1980": {
      "citation": "D. G. Miller, J. A. Rard, L. B. Eppstein, R. A. Robinson, Mutual diffusion coefficients, electrical conductances, osmotic coefficients, and ionic transport coefficients for aqueous CuSO4 at 25 °C, Journal of Solution Chemistry 9 (1980), 467–496. DOI: 10.1007/BF00647737.",
      "url": "https://doi.org/10.1007/BF00647737",
      "data_note_zh": "摘要确认该研究覆盖低浓度至近饱和的 CuSO4 水溶液，包含互扩散、电导、渗透系数和经比较的迁移数数据；当前仅登记数据覆盖信息，未从全文表格逐点数字化，不能据此插值。"
    },
    "daniel_albright_1991": {
      "citation": "V. Daniel, J. G. Albright, Measurement of mutual-diffusion coefficients for the system KNO3–H2O at 25 °C, Journal of Solution Chemistry 20 (1991), 633–642. DOI: 10.1007/BF00647073.",
      "url": "https://doi.org/10.1007/BF00647073",
      "data_note_zh": "原摘要报告浓度范围 0.025–2.61 mol/L，并给出扩散系数随浓度总体下降的端点摘要；摘要没有给出 0.100 M 的精确测点值。"
    }
  },
